※ pl4g-test: module
※※ Two of a kind.

※※ Two values of one type.
@[export]
type Two(T') = first : T' ; second : T'

※※ Both values, the first first.
※※
※※ \param t the two
※※ \param a the arena the walk is made in
※※ \return each of the two
@[export]
fn Two.each(t: Two(T'), a: &mut arena) ⇉ T':
    yield t.first
    yield t.second
